            <ArticleTitle>[Myocardial perfusion studies during exertion and rest performed at the Hospital Militar Gorgas (HMG)].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>140-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report the experience at Gorgas Army Hospital with myocardial perfusion studies by single-photon emission tomography. We describe the technique, the specificity and sensitivity, and its use in the diagnosis, evaluation of extension and prognosis of coronary artery disease.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
